            4355
        ],
        "nom_orig": "Maya",
        "texte_orig": "That's[SP]why[SP]I...[SP]I[SP]wanted[SP]to[SP]be[SP]a[SP]successful\njournalist[SP]who[SP]could[SP]balance[SP]my[SP]work[SP]with\na[SP]family,[SP]the[SP]way[SP]he[SP]couldn't...",
