            4355
        ],
        "nom_orig": "Maya",
        "texte_orig": "Worse[SP]than[SP]alone[SP]/[SP]Exiled.[1205][001E]\nWorse[SP]than[SP]exiled[SP]/[SP]Dead.[1205][001E]\nWorse[SP]than[SP]dead[SP]/[SP]Forgotten.",
